<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT -Unibanco cut, Mavesa added to list.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT -Unibanco cut, Mavesa added to list.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns &amp; Co said on Wednesday analyst David Chon had cut Brazil's Unibanco from its Top Picks list and added Venezuelan foods group Mavesa to the listing.</p>
<p>-- The changes were made March 11.</p>
<p>-- In a report, Chon said Unibanco was cut because of &quot;price appreciation (up 22.2 percent year to date) and weaker margins in its core business.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Mavesa was added based on value and growth.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
